erefore is  against God's will  the homosexual pairing has very little  to do with morality as far as the gulls  are concerned George and Molly received  letters postcards and phone calls from  members of the LGBT community thanking  them for their bravery this research  transcended into music cartoons and even  plays that's the best you can hope for  in science is that a piece of work is  used by other scientists and a really  big bonus is if it makes a difference to  the people of a nation that's supported  [Music]
 

